  "description": "Operating area: Phuket\n\nDiscover the future of luxury yachting with E-MOTION, the first electric Sunreef sailing catamaran in the Asia Pacific, now available for charter in Phuket.\n\nThis innovative vessel combines silent cruising with eco-conscious technology, making it the perfect choice for those who want sustainability without sacrificing comfort or performance.\n\nExplore the stunning islands around Phuket on a smooth, emissions-free journey with E-MOTION. Whether you’re heading to Phi Phi, Phang Nga Bay, or the Similans, this electric catamaran delivers a refined and peaceful cruising experience.\n\nOnboard, enjoy an array of water toys including paddle boards, Seabobs, and Williams jet tender for high-speed island exploration.\n\nThe spacious layout comfortably accommodates up to 8 guests in 4 elegant en-suite cabins, making E-MOTION ideal for family escapes or a stylish getaway with friends.\n\nHer full-time professional crew, including a private chef, ensures every moment onboard is effortless, from gourmet meals to five-star service.\n\nCharter the future today!",
